  "title": "Heavenly Fluffy Thai Coconut Khanom Krok",
  "description": "A citrusy and fluffy Thai dessert featuring meringue nests, this dish is a crowd-pleaser from the streets of Bangkok, made with sashimi-cut ingredients and ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly principles in mind.",
