  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Mix the rice flour and palm sugar in a bowl.",
    "Add the coconut milk, eggs, coconut oil, salt, lime zest, and lime juice to the bowl and mix until smooth.",
    "Stir in the pandan extract.",
    "Pour the mixture into a khanom krok pan or a mini muffin tin.",
    "Bake for 15 minutes or until the edges are lightly golden.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
